# The pointer on the quit box (Rerac-vr's pause/pointer.rs Quit): paused, Options, its Quit Game row; the box's upper line
# (No, Triangle's) and lower line (Yes, Circle's) each answered by the trigger as its key alone. The trigger on No goes back
# to Options; Quit Game again, and the trigger on Yes quits to the title ([vr-state] phase).
